   ],
   "info": "The wooden kiosk fountain in Baščaršija's square, built by Alexander Vitkovac in 1891 after the Ottoman one of 1753. Drink from it, the saying goes, and you will come back to Sarajevo. Its square is called Pigeon Square, for good reason."
  },
  {
