   "wall": 12,
   "dome": 13,
   "minaret": 45,
   "porch": 5,
   "clear": [
    22,
    0
   ],
   "info": "Built in 1530 by Ajem Esir Ali, the Persian who later built for Suleiman in Istanbul, for Gazi Husrev-beg, the governor who made Sarajevo a city. Its dome is 26 m high; its minaret 45 m. The first mosque in the world to have electric light, in 1898."
  },
