   "model": "oldbridge",
   "road": "Latinska ćuprija",
   "arches": 4,
   "info": "An Ottoman stone bridge of four arches, rebuilt in 1798, its piers pierced by round eyes for the floods. At its north end, on 28 June 1914, Gavrilo Princip shot the Archduke Franz Ferdinand and his wife Sophie, and Europe went to war."
  },
  {
