   ],
   "at": [
    43.85798,
    18.42899
   ],
   "info": "The corner building where Moritz Schiller had his delicatessen in 1914. Princip was standing outside it when the Archduke's car turned into Franz Joseph Street by mistake and stopped in front of him. A museum of the Austro-Hungarian years now."
  },
